": "Section II - 20 marks (pages 6-7)", "x0": 0.26703296703296703, "y0": 0.6682206682206682, "x1": 0.578021978021978, "y1": 0.6814296814296814}, {"text": "+ Attempt Question 2", "x0": 0.2681318681318681, "y0": 0.6923076923076923, "x1": 0.4582417582417582, "y1": 0.7055167055167055}, {"text": "+ Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.2681318681318681, "y0": 0.714063714063714, "x1": 0.6351648351648351, "y1": 0.7241647241647242}, {"text": "Section III - 20 marks (page 8)", "x0": 0.26703296703296703, "y0": 0.7466977466977467, "x1": 0.5516483516483517, "y1": 0.7599067599067599}, {"text": "+ Attempt Question 3", "x0": 0.2681318681318681, "y0": 0.7715617715617715, "x1": 0.4582417582417582, "y1": 0.7847707847707848}, {"text": "+ Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.2681318681318681, "y0": 0.7925407925407926, "x1": 0.6351648351648351, "y1": 0.8026418026418026}, {"text": "1035", "x0": 0.08241758241758242, "y0": 0.9463869463869464, "x1": 0.11758241758241758, "y1": 0.9549339549339549}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43626373626373627, "y0": 0.3550893550893551, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.3644133644133644}], [{"text": "Section I \u2014 Module A: Textual Conversations", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.5857142857142857, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "20 marks", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.11655011655011654, "x1": 0.1989010989010989, "y1": 0.12665112665112666}, {"text": "Attempt Question 1", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.13286713286713286, "x1": 0.2868131868131868, "y1": 0.14607614607614608}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.14996114996114995, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.16006216006216006}, {"text": "Answer the question on pages 2-8 of the Paper 2 Writing Booklet. Extra writing booklets are", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.18337218337218336, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.19658119658119658}, {"text": "available.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.20046620046620048, "x1": 0.1956043956043956, "y1": 0.2097902097902098}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.22999222999222999, "x1": 0.5274725274725275, "y1": 0.2432012432012432}, {"text": "demonstrate understanding of how composers are influenced by another text\u2019s", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.2501942501942502, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.2634032634032634}, {"text": "concepts and values", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.26728826728826727, "x1": 0.3274725274725275, "y1": 0.27972027972027974}, {"text": "\u00a9 evaluate the relationships between texts and contexts", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.2867132867132867, "x1": 0.5945054945054945, "y1": 0.2999222999222999}, {"text": "* organise, develop and express ideas using language appropriate to audience, purpose", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.30691530691530694, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.3201243201243201}, {"text": "and form", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.32323232323232326, "x1": 0.23956043956043957, "y1": 0.3333333333333333}, {"text": "Question 1 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3690753690753691, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.3815073815073815}, {"text": "To what extent has your perspective of the earlier text determined your interpretation and", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.4024864024864025, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.4156954156954157}, {"text": "appreciation of the later text?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4188034188034188, "x1": 0.35604395604395606, "y1": 0.432012432012432}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to both of your prescribed texts.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4522144522144522, "x1": 0.7230769230769231, "y1": 0.4654234654234654}, {"text": "The Module A prescribed texts are listed on pages 4-5.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.5027195027195027, "x1": 0.5692307692307692, "y1": 0.5151515151515151}], [{"text": "The Module A prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.07925407925407925, "x1": 0.4054945054945055, "y1": 0.0979020979020979}, {"text": "+ Shakespearean Drama and Film", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.12354312354312354, "x1": 0.421978021978022, "y1": 0.13675213675213677}, {"text": "\u2014 William Shakespeare, King Richard III", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.14685314685314685, "x1": 0.4846153846153846, "y1": 0.16006216006216006}, {"text": "and", "x0": 0.26263736263736265, "y0": 0.17094017094017094, "x1": 0.29010989010989013, "y1": 0.18026418026418026}, {"text": "Al Pacino, Looking for Richard", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.19347319347319347, "x1": 0.4230769230769231, "y1": 0.2066822066822067}, {"text": "+ Prose Fiction and Film", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.23543123543123542, "x1": 0.3395604395604396, "y1": 0.24553224553224554}, {"text": "~ Virginia Woolf, Mrs Dalloway", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.25874125874125875, "x1": 0.4175824175824176, "y1": 0.27195027195027194}, {"text": "and", "x0": 0.26263736263736265, "y0": 0.2828282828282828, "x1": 0.29010989010989013, "y1": 0.29215229215229216}, {"text": "Stephen Daldry, The Hours", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.30536130536130535, "x1": 0.389010989010989, "y1": 0.3185703185703186}, {"text": "* Prose Fiction and Prose Fiction", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3473193473193473, "x1": 0.41318681318681316, "y1": 0.35742035742035744}, {"text": "\u2014 Albert Camus, The Stranger", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.3714063714063714, "x1": 0.3967032967032967, "y1": 0.3838383838383838}, {"text": "and", "x0": 0.26263736263736265, "y0": 0.3947163947163947, "x1": 0.29010989010989013, "y1": 0.40404040404040403}, {"text": "\u2014 Kamel Daoud, The Meursault Investigation", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.4188034188034188, "x1": 0.5186813186813187, "y1": 0.43123543123543123}, {"text": "+ Poetry and Drama", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4592074592074592, "x1": 0.3032967032967033, "y1": 0.47241647